<div class="content">
<section id="sec1">
<div class="sect-subtitle right-align-dec" data-top-bottom="transform: translateY(200px);" data-bottom-top="transform: translateY(-200px);"><span>42</span></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<h2 class="section-title"><strong> INTER-DEALER BROKER</strong></h2>
<p><strong>We intermediate trades in government bonds, interest rate and currency derivatives and deposits. We are specialized in the intermediation of trades between banking counterparties. We have many years of experience, and our clients are major European banks and multinational banking/financial institutions. With us they have a team of experienced brokers and modern trading platforms at their disposal. </strong> <br><br>We can provide accurate and fast information on prices and liquidity of financial instruments. This increases market liquidity and helps you find the best trading opportunities. <br><br>Thanks to the neutral position we take in the entire trade brokerage process and the anonymity we provide to our clients when negotiating trade parameters, we guarantee objectivity, transparency, and high efficiency. <br><br>Want to know more? Do not hesitate to contact us, we will be happy to explain everything in detail. <br><br>You can also find out more about our product offer and the trading process in the "Regulatory hub" section.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6">
<div class="xparallax-box"><br><img src="/images/page/Foto/IDB%20Broker%20detai.jpg" class="respimg" alt=""></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>
<div class="content dark-bg"><!-- parallax image  -->
<div class="parallax-inner">
<div class="bg" data-bg="/template/images/bg/1.jpg" data-top-bottom="transform: translateY(300px);" data-bottom-top="transform: translateY(-300px);"></div>
<div class="overlay"></div>
</div>
<!-- parallax image  end -->
<section><!--  container  -->
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-4">
<h2 class="section-title">We're <strong> hiring</strong></h2>
</div>
<div class="col-md-8">
<p class="p">The quality of the service we provide to our customers is crucial to us. We want to be the best at what we do. We believe that success can only be achieved with a quality team of colleagues, which is why we are always looking for great new colleagues to join us at 42 Financial Services.</p>
<a class="btn btn-secondary btn-white mt-20" href="/we-are-hiring/">Want to be part of 42 FS team</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<!--  container  end --></section>
</div>





